title: Barracuda CloudGen Firewall: Sessions and Throughput
agents: snmp
catalog: app/barracuda
license: GPLv2
distribution: phion
description:
 This check monitors the overall load of a Barracuda CloudGen Firewall
 using the Phion-MIB. It reports the number of concurrent sessions, the
 packet throughput and the data throughput of the firewall.

 Upper levels can be configured for all three values via the ruleset
 "Phion/Barracuda Firewall".

discovery:
 One service named {Firewall} is created per device.
